{"id":"75b2e6453cca837c","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-spectral-theorem-normal.md","title":"Normal Operator Spectral Forms","display":"df-spectral-theorem-normal — Normal Operator Spectral Forms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spectral-theorem-normal","aliases":["58-df-spectral-theorem-normal"],"display":"df-spectral-theorem-normal — Normal Operator Spectral Forms","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spectral-theorem-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spectral-theorem-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectral-theorem-normal — Normal Operator Spectral Forms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T^*,E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\">\\(T,T^*,E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\exists T^*\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T^*,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,T^*(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\land T^*\\circ T=T\\circ T^*\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\exists T^*\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T^*,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,T^*(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\land T^*\\circ T=T\\circ T^*\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\to V\\land E(\\varnothing)=0_{\\mathcal H}\\land E(\\mathbb C)=I_{\\mathcal H}\\land\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(\\Delta),\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land E(\\Delta)\\circ E(\\Delta)=E(\\Delta)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle E(\\Delta)(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,E(\\Delta)(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\right)\\land\\forall\\Delta_\\bullet:\\omega\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\bigl(\\forall i\\neq j\\;(\\Delta_i\\cap\\Delta_j=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\to\\forall u\\in\\mathcal H\\;E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\Delta_j\\right)(u)=\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}E(\\Delta_j)(u)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\to V\\land E(\\varnothing)=0_{\\mathcal H}\\land E(\\mathbb C)=I_{\\mathcal H}\\land\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(\\Delta),\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land E(\\Delta)\\circ E(\\Delta)=E(\\Delta)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle E(\\Delta)(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,E(\\Delta)(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\right)\\land\\forall\\Delta_\\bullet:\\omega\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\bigl(\\forall i\\neq j\\;(\\Delta_i\\cap\\Delta_j=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\to\\forall u\\in\\mathcal H\\;E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\Delta_j\\right)(u)=\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}E(\\Delta_j)(u)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S(E,T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land T=\\int_{\\mathbb C}\\lambda\\,dE(\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S(E,T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land T=\\int_{\\mathbb C}\\lambda\\,dE(\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The spectral theorem states that every bounded normal operator has a unique complex PVM satisfying the representation predicate.</li>\n<li>Unitary operators are normal with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(T) \\subseteq \\mathbb{T}\">\\(\\sigma(T) \\subseteq \\mathbb{T}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Unitary and self-adjoint operators are treated as derived special cases in this file's context.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is normal iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|Tx\\| = \\|T^*x\\|\">\\(\\|Tx\\| = \\|T^*x\\|\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In the standard multiplication-operator form, unitary equivalence may require a direct-integral or multiplicity-space formulation.</li>\n<li>The integral is written over all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span> so that this atom does not rely on an undeclared operator-spectrum selector; concentration on the operator spectrum is a theorem about the representing PVM.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,T^*,E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\exists T^*\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T^*,\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle T(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,T^*(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\land T^*\\circ T=T\\circ T^*\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land E:\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\to V\\land E(\\varnothing)=0_{\\mathcal H}\\land E(\\mathbb C)=I_{\\mathcal H}\\land\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(\\Delta),\\mathcal H,\\mathcal H)\\land E(\\Delta)\\circ E(\\Delta)=E(\\Delta)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(\\langle E(\\Delta)(x),y\\rangle=\\langle x,E(\\Delta)(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\right)\\land\\forall\\Delta_\\bullet:\\omega\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\;\\left(\\bigl(\\forall i\\neq j\\;(\\Delta_i\\cap\\Delta_j=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\to\\forall u\\in\\mathcal H\\;E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\Delta_j\\right)(u)=\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}E(\\Delta_j)(u)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormalSpectralRepresentation}_S(E,T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalOperator}_S(T,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexPVM}_S(E,\\mathcal H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land T=\\int_{\\mathbb C}\\lambda\\,dE(\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma(T) \\subseteq \\mathbb{T}","display":fals